      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-12-28T14:14:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, this is cover by TetheringTest#testBluetoothServiceDisconnects. If the bluetooth crash (onUnavailable called), the test verifyNetdCommandForBtTearDown which means IpServer is disabled because netd command is called from IpServer.",
