        "id": 1308504
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-12-28T14:14:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, this means the bug in bluetooth that onAvailable get called 1+ times without onUnavailable. If this case happen, we will see below log print from ensureIpServerStarted.\n\n\"active iface (bt-pan) reported as added, ignoring\"",
      "parentUuid": "495df5d7_ba153c81",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 846,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 846,
        "endChar": 27
      },
