      "lineNbr": 854,
      "author": {
        "id": 1308504
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-12-28T14:14:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, we should NOT null out mBluetoothCallback and mBluetoothInterface. User could disconnect PAN (e.g. disconnect bluetooth pair) without disable tethering settings. When PAN reconnects (re-pair bluetooth and trigger bluetooth tethering), bluetooth would just call onAvailable without calling startTethering again.\n\nAlso add the test to verify the behavior mentioned above.",
      "parentUuid": "c9146922_103ef859",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 854,
        "startChar": 44,
        "endLine": 854,
        "endChar": 45
      },
      "revId": "b1d95c3900c18a58b779c6915368425a07ae4f21",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
